WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.420
Let's try it on something real.

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.520
Copy the request on this screen,

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.240
change the parts in brackets to your own details,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.300
and send it.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.307
You'll get an email draft you can actually use.

